      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'General Info: \n

    - Player Is Always In [Moving State]. \n

    -
    Going downhill in [Moving State] Will Cause The Player To Enter The [Slide State].
    \n

    - If You Are Going Too Slow While In [Slide State], The Player Will Enter
    The [Sneak State]. \n

    - Additionally, [Sneak State] Can Be Entered By Pressing
    "LeftShift". \n

    - In [Sneak State], The Player Will Not Slide While Going
    Downhill. \n

    - Leaving [Sneak State] Can Be Done By Pressing "LeftShift",
    entering Moving State].  '
